		"name": "PayLedger API",
		"description": "Postman collection for all currently implemented PayLedger backend APIs.\n\n### Base URL\n`http://localhost:5001/api/v1`\n\n### Authentication & Security Architecture\n- **Access Tokens**: Short-lived (15 minutes) stateless JWTs.\n- **Refresh Tokens**: Long-lived (30 days) stateful tokens with cryptographic SHA-256 hashes persisted in PostgreSQL `user_sessions`.\n- **Cookie Transport**: Authentication tokens are stored and transmitted exclusively via HTTP-only, Secure, SameSite cookies (`access_token` and `refresh_token`). Tokens are never returned in JSON response bodies.\n- **Rate Limiting**: Express middleware backed by Redis enforces sliding window IP rate limits across authentication endpoints.\n- **Account Lockout**: 5 consecutive failed login attempts trigger an automatic 15-minute account lockout.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
