						"description": "Registers a new user account, creates an initial wallet with 0 balance, establishes an authenticated session, and writes an audit log in a single atomic database transaction.\n\n### Requirements\n- **name**: String (2 to 100 characters).\n- **mobile**: Valid 10-digit Indian mobile number (`^[6-9]\\d{9}$`).\n- **email**: Optional string (valid email format, max 255 characters).\n- **password**: String (8 to 128 characters).\n\n### Cookies Set\n- `access_token` (HTTP-only, 15m expiry)\n- `refresh_token` (HTTP-only, 30d expiry)"
					},
