						"description": "Authenticates an existing user using their registered mobile number and password verified with Argon2id.\n\n### Security & Policy Rules\n- **No User Enumeration**: Returns generic `INVALID_CREDENTIALS` for both non-existent users and wrong passwords.\n- **Account Lockout**: 5 failed login attempts will temporarily lock the account for 15 minutes (`locked_until`).\n- **Rate Limiting**: IP rate limited via Redis middleware (`RATE_LIMIT_LOGIN_MAX` requests per `RATE_LIMIT_LOGIN_WINDOW_SECONDS`).\n\n### Cookies Set\n- `access_token` (HTTP-only, 15m expiry)\n- `refresh_token` (HTTP-only, 30d expiry)"
					},
