							"path": [
								"auth",
								"logout"
							]
						},
						"description": "Logs out the current user session idempotently.\n\n### Mechanics\n- Reads `refresh_token` or `access_token` from cookies to identify and revoke the session in PostgreSQL `user_sessions`.\n- Clears `access_token` and `refresh_token` cookies on the client response.\n- Idempotent: Does not fail even if cookies are missing or the session has already expired.\n\n### Cookies Cleared\n- `access_token`\n- `refresh_token`"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "200 OK - Logout Successful",
